FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T0Intro::
    .string "Steel does not rust, and neither\n"
    .string "does our watch.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T0Defeat::
    .string "Rusted through...$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T0Post::
    .string "The WARDEN is further on.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T1Intro::
    .string "The ancient one hums when the\n"
    .string "sky cracks. We keep it quiet.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T1Defeat::
    .string "Bent out of shape.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T1Post::
    .string "Keep going. It only gets harder.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T2Intro::
    .string "No one walks to the shore alone\n"
    .string "anymore.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T2Defeat::
    .string "The seam gave way.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T2Post::
    .string "The WARDEN has heard you coming.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T3Intro::
    .string "The beast gave us shelter when\n"
    .string "the sky turned. We stay for it.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T3Defeat::
    .string "The forge cools.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T3Post::
    .string "Almost there. Mind your pride.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T4Intro::
    .string "I am the WARDEN of the STEEL.\n"
    .string "The beast sleeps in my care.\p"
    .string "Prove that your will is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T4Defeat::
    .string "...Then the iron has chosen you.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_T4Post::
    .string "Go. Do not let it rust.$"

FiveIsland_Meadow_SteelDen_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"
